o_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将检测这段视频前10秒内的行人和车辆，并跟踪它们是移动还是停留","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、车辆移动或停留","时间范围":"前 10 秒"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_8a8e7a","text":"检测这段视频前 10 秒里的行人和车辆，并跟踪它们是移动还是停留。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_ef4377","text":"读取输入视频文件，解析视频元数据（时长、帧率），严格按前10秒时间范围截取画面序列并完成帧级结构化采样与预处理，输出待检测的连续帧数据集。"},{"task_span_id":"span_d012a4","text":"调用视频监控场景的目标检测能力，对前10秒采样帧进行逐帧扫描，识别并框选“行人”与“车辆”两类目标，为每个独立目标分配唯一跟踪ID，输出包含类别标签与位置信息的初始检测结果列表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_bc02c5","text":"基于多目标时序跟踪能力，在时间轴上关联同一跟踪ID的边界框中心点坐标，计算各目标在10秒窗口内的累计位移量或轨迹变化率；依据预设的位移阈值与判断口径，将目标运动状态分类为“移动”或“停留”，输出带时序轨迹的状态判定表。"},{"task_span_id":"span_61f40f","text":"汇总检测与跟踪研判结果，按视频对象类型、跟踪ID、出现时段、运动状态分类及置信度等关键指标生成结构化交付清单，确保输出形式严格对应原始任务的参数要求，完成最终任务交付。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_7dca2e","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这段视频前10秒内的行人和车辆，并跟踪它们是移动还是停留。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、车辆移动或停留","时间范围":"前 10 秒"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_7dca2e","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这段视频前10秒内的行人和车辆，并跟踪它们是移动还是停留。","params":{"视频对象":"这段视频","监控目标":"行人、车辆移动或停留","时间范围":"前 10 秒"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:3063c4e3-eeeb-4da7-a02a-b90657104631"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n检测这段视频前 10 秒里的行人和车辆，并跟踪它们是移动还是停留。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic.mp4 (72.4 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n检测这段视频前 10 秒里的行人和车辆，并跟踪它们是移动还是停留。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream